	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<note type="regest">Wohl während der von <persName>J. Ulstetter</persName> an HB, 5. April 1554 erwähnten schweren Erkrankung Erbs.</note>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia filii dei tecum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Paucis tę humanitati <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>scribo, d. <persName ref="p2836">Heinryche</persName>, quoniam manus lassę et <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tremulę aegre suum faciunt officium propter gravem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>morbum, qui mihi et vires et ingenium ita debi<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>litavit, ut deinceps ad omnia inutilis expectem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>gloriosum domini adventum, ut me eripiat ex presenti <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>seculo nequam ac propter mortem filii sui remittens peccata <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>mea ex gratia vitę aeterne praemium largiatur, amen.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Ego clamo iamiam luctans cum morte cum <persName>Bernhardo <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Clarevallensi</persName>, qui morti vicinus aiebat: "Fateor, non sum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>dignus ego nec propriis possum meritis regnum cęlorum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>obtinere, ceterum duplici iure id obtinens... <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>hereditate scilicet patris et merito passionis altero ipso <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>contentus, alterum mihi donat; ex cuius dono iure <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>illud mihi mendicans non confundar" etc.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Cum igitur, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>iam sub potentis dei manu, quę benigniter et clementer mecum a<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>git, suspirem futuram patriam, oro te, frater in Christo observande, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>cum tuis sanctis fratribus, orate pro me, ut deus sua solita <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>clementia in solita pietatis confessione me conservet, ne <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Satanę sutelis exagitatus fluctuem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Cupio <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ergo dissolvi et esse cum Christo<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Phil 1, 23</ref></cit>.</note> in illis cęlestibus man<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>sionibus ab aeterno electis dei paratis, quas brevi <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>per Christum me adsequuturum non diffido.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Intelligo dei <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>gratiam lenta morte me ad se vocantem, ita paulatim <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>vires ęgri corporis exolescunt.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">O pater, in manus <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tuas commendo spiritum meum per Iesum Christum.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Amen.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Rursum me commendo vestris sanctis precibus, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>amen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis omnes in Christo fratres.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Scribere no/volebam; <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>sed debile ingenium plus parturiit, quam <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>sperabam.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">At ipsa charitas suppeditat vires.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale igitur <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>et vive in Christo, cui hactenus constanter <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>in aedificio ecclesię dei ministrasti.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Perge feliciter, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>et erit magna merces operi tuo in regno dei.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Amen.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Die ascensionis Christi, quando dei filius suum <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>immortale corpus intulit cęlo sedens ad dexteram de<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>i patris <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p1010">Erbius</persName> e<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>x pectore <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>dei regnum amans.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Viro optimo veręque theo<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>logię confessori d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, fratri observando etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
